# Release signing material. Never commit a release keystore: the release build
# reads it from KEYSTORE_PATH / STORE_PASSWORD / KEY_PASSWORD instead.
# (`debug.keystore` is intentionally tracked: it is the standard AOSP debug
# key with the well-known "android" password, used only for local installs.
# The release build type uses a different, out-of-band signingConfig.)
*.jks
release*.keystore
